// §2.4. A vertical city of glass and steel towers, screens everywhere (facades, poles, the ground)
// showing Kimiko, the anime idol (pink hair, cat ears); yellow Cocket barricades closing the
// avenues; the crowd frozen before the giant screen of the Place de l'Écran; north, the Tower
// (the Antenna) rising from an esplanade of black marble, its Grande Porte barred by a laser; east,
// the fenced Bassin de Captage; south, the grey concrete Quai des Eaux Grises. Cold, administrative.
